        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 3044-8 8 Inch Commercial Double Acting Spring Hinges</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n8\" Double Acting Spring Hinge. Box clamp type door flange is attached to door with thrubolts and nuts. Jamb flange is secured to frame with screws. For doors 1-3/4\" thick packaged with all mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bommer 3044-8 Double Acting Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish:  Primer</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Template</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Tension</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness:  1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing:  90º each direction</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3044-8x200.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 3044-8 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Suggested Hinge Locations</b> for Bommer 3044-8 Double Acting Spring Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>If Using 2 Hinges: one at top, one at bottom</li>\r\n<li>If Using 3 hinges: two at top, one at bottom</li>\r\n<li>If Using 4 hinges: two at top, one at bottom, one intermediate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><!-- START -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"50\">\r\n<td colspan=\"5\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer 3044  Selection for Maximum Door Size & <br>Weights for \r\n  Doors 7'-0\" Minimum Height</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"110\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"110\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td width=\"110\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td width=\"110\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td width=\"110\">4 Hinges</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Door Weight</td>\r\n<td>Door Weight</td>\r\n<td>Door Weight</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td rowspan=\"5\">3044-8</td>\r\n<td>3'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>265 lbs</td>\r\n<td>400 lbs</td>\r\n<td>560 lbs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>3'-6\"</td>\r\n<td>245 lbs</td>\r\n<td>360 lbs</td>\r\n<td>500 lbs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>4'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>225 lbs</td>\r\n<td>320 lbs</td>\r\n<td>440 lbs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>4'-6\"</td>\r\n<td>185 lbs</td>\r\n<td>280 lbs</td>\r\n<td>380 lbs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>5'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>165 lbs</td>\r\n<td>240 lbs</td>\r\n<td>320 lbs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"5\"><span class=\"text\"><b>Note:</b> This chart shows that as \r\nthe door width increases the weight each hinge will hold is reduced.  The Doorbox clamps thickness is not adjustable. \r\n   </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END  -->\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>Bommer 3044-8 available for 5 different Door Thickness</b>\r\n<li>Bommer 3044-8-1.750: 1-3/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Bommer 3044-8-1.875: 1-7/8\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Bommer 3044-8-2.000: 2\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Bommer 3044-8-2.250: 2-1/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Bommer 3044-8-2.500: 2-1/2\" Thick Door</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).\r\n<br><br>** 1-3/4\" thick doorbox clamps are normally in stock, all other sizes are special order 3-5 weeks to ship. </b>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges). \r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n**This item is Discontinued. \r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
